<title>USA: Elbit Ltd Q4 net loss narrowed.</title>
<headline>Elbit Ltd Q4 net loss narrowed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Year Ended  For the Three Months</p>
<p>			  December 31, 1996  Ended December 31,1996</p>
<p>				    1996     1995    1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net Revenues		   33.6     57.4	10	    10</p>
